                    <div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">About the location - Headquarters (Elk Grove, CA)<br /><br /> </span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Located less than 30 minutes from Sacramento and Lodi, the progressive city of Elk Grove offers a great mix of newly developed housing, business projects, and recreational opportunities. You will enjoy working at our campus-style office complex with free parking, and perhaps even call Elk Grove home.<br /><br /> </span><p style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Telework</span></strong>: <br />The </span><span style="color: #333333;">position(s) is eligible for hybrid telework, &nbsp;in accordance with the Statewide Telework Policy and will be required to report to the office as needed/required. The successful candidate must reside in California upon appointment.</span></span></span></p> </div>
