ormance-management-merit-system-principles.aspx</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-style: italic;">This webpage is intended to provide general information. Benefit eligibility may be based on job classification, bargaining unit, time base and length of appointment.</span></span></span></p>
